  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ、灯織\r\n次の出番まで少し間があるが、調子はどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーもお疲れ様です\r\n今のところは順調だと思います",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分が役と同じ情報しか持っていないのは、\r\n難しいですが面白いです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『自分』が周りの人にどう思われているのか、\r\nこれからどうなっていくのか、全然見えないのが新鮮で……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──それに、さっき",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "めぐると少し会ったんですが、\r\n一瞬知らない人に見えたんです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもみたいに答え合わせができないからこそ気になるし、\r\nつい見てしまう、ってことか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001052030240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まるで出会った頃に戻ったみたいな、\r\n懐かしいような不思議な気分でした",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400105203/4001052030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふふ、まだ親しく話しかけるのにも\r\nためらいがあった頃、みたいにかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
